# Morrowind Temple: Tuls Valen's "Dark Cult in Hassour" (TT_Hassour). Tuls Valen sends the player against Dagoth
# Fovon in Hassour ("Hassour": 10); with him dead, Tuls Valen pays in cure blight scrolls and potions (100) and has no
# more duties ("duties": TT_MaarGan 110).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel, the kill for the fight. Ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05:
# 057FF42E Dagoth Fovon.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_disciple --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_hassour_start
run
player->PositionCell 3637 3900 14723 0 "Ald-ruhn, Temple"
until 600 "tuls valen"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tuls valen
ask duties
ask Hassour
expect GetJournalIndex TT_Hassour == 10
bye
end

case tt_hassour_fovon
run
player->PositionCell 4833 2850 12576 0 "Hassour, Shrine"
until 600 "dagoth fovon"->GetDistance player < 1500
wait 120
console 057FF42E.kill
until 600 GetDeadCount "dagoth fovon" >= 1
end

case tt_hassour_done
run
player->PositionCell 3637 3900 14723 0 "Ald-ruhn, Temple"
until 600 "tuls valen"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tuls valen
ask Hassour
expect GetJournalIndex TT_Hassour == 100
ask duties
expect GetJournalIndex TT_MaarGan == 110
bye
end
